ft","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"108003-EPILOGUE:10302:8","scriptId":10302,"text":"“最后一班岗自然是责任最大的人来站咯。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":39,"right":3,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"108003-EPILOGUE:10302:9","scriptId":10302,"text":"“……好吧。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":39,"right":3,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"108003-EPILOGUE:10303:1","scriptId":10303,"text":"日落西山，我们到达了一个废弃的中继站。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":39,"right":3,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":31,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"108003-EPILOGUE:10303:2","scriptId":10303,"text":"“这个中继站我们以前实训演习的时候也使用过，真是怀念啊。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":31,"right":3,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"108003-EPILOGUE:10303:3","scriptId":10303,"text":"伏龙芝学院每半学期就会进行一次实训演习。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":31,"right":3,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"108003-EPILOGUE:10303:4","scriptId":10303,"text":"学生们会按小组被分配到各个中继站进行实训演习课程。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":31,"right":3,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1170,"speaker":"夏虹萤","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"108003-EPILOGUE:10303:5","scriptId":10303,"text":"“那我先站第一班岗，接下来依次是佐伊、小兰，最后是长官。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":31,"right":1170,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1158,"speaker":"陈雯兰","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"108003-EPILOGUE:10303:6","scriptId":10303,"text":"“没问题。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":1158,"right":1170,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"108003-EPILOGUE:10303:7","scriptId":10303,"text":"“诶？我也要！？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":1158,"right":3,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":39,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"108003-EPILOGUE:10303:8","scriptId":10303,"text":"“最后一班岗自然是责任最大的人来站咯。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":39,"right":3,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"108003-EPILOGUE:10303:9","scriptId":10303,"text":"“……好吧。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":39,"right":3,"section":5,"shake":false}],"summaries":["向伏龙芝军事上层报告了遭遇人形怪物的情况，静等回音。","赶往伏龙芝学院的途中，找索菲亚教授聊聊。","快要看到军事学院了，等等，整个小镇都在冒烟？"]}
